# bindings for adding a text note/comment
# (plain letters, not comma-prefixed: your custom Slovak/Ukelele keyboard layout
# doesn't register ',' correctly in sioyek's key parser)
# first draw the rectangle where the note should go, then trigger the text prompt
select_rect w
_add_text c
_remove_annotation x
_edit_text e
_show_bindings ?

# Map copy to Cmd+C on Mac (D- = Command key modifier)
copy <D-c>
toggle_dark_mode <D-d>
